    "title": "Partition and Indian Punjab",
    "lead": "The line was published two days after freedom. What followed was the largest movement of people in modern history, and a province that had to be built again from half of itself. This part goes from that August to the fields and the arguments of today.",
    "words": 13940,
    "minutes": 63,
